From: TJ Sweet <timothyswt@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 17 Apr 2026 23:39:26 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] fix(bolt): honor configured bind address and refresh deps

- resolve Bolt and HTTP bind address from CLI, config, and env precedence
- add Bolt host binding support and regression coverage
- bump yzma to v1.12.0
- bump ui dev deps: postcss to 8.5.10 and typescript to 6.0.3
